msgid "Start face scan"
msgstr "Anza kuchanganua uso"

#: src/onboarding.py:559 src/onboarding.py:613
msgid "Scan face model"
msgstr "Changanua mfano wa uso"

#: src/onboarding.py:563
msgid "Can't save face model"
msgstr "Haiwezi kuhifadhi muundo wa uso"

#: src/onboarding.py:568 src/onboarding.py:624
msgid "Scan second model"
msgstr "Changanua mfano wa pili"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid "Couldn't record the second model"
msgstr "Haikuweza kurekodi muundo wa pili"

#: src/onboarding.py:572
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved, so face login already works. Make sure your"
" face is well lit and centred, then try again -- or skip and add a mod"
"el later from Settings."
msgstr ""
"Muundo wako wa kwanza umehifadhiwa, kwa hivyo kuingia kwa uso tayari k"
"unafanya kazi. Hakikisha kuwa uso wako una mwanga wa kutosha na umewek"
"wa katikati, kisha ujaribu tena -- au ruka na uongeze muundo baadaye k"
"utoka kwa Mipangilio."

#: src/onboarding.py:607
msgid "Add a face model (required)"
msgstr "Ongeza muundo wa uso (unahitajika)"

#: src/onboarding.py:609
msgid ""
"Face login needs at least one face model, so this scan can't be skippe"
"d. Record it in the light you usually sit in. Lighting changes how you"
"r face looks to the camera, so consider adding a second model later fr"
"om Settings, recorded in different light (for example evening lamps in"
"stead of daylight)."
msgstr ""
"Kuingia kwa uso kunahitaji angalau muundo mmoja wa uso, kwa hivyo skan"
"a hii haiwezi kurukwa. Irekodi katika mwanga unaokaa. Mwangaza hubadil"
"isha jinsi uso wako unavyoonekana kwenye kamera, kwa hivyo zingatia ku"
"ongeza muundo wa pili baadaye kutoka kwa Mipangilio, iliyorekodiwa kwa"
" mwanga tofauti (kwa mfano taa za jioni badala ya mchana)."

#: src/onboarding.py:618
msgid "Add a second face model (recommended)"
msgstr "Ongeza muundo wa pili wa uso (inapendekezwa)"

#: src/onboarding.py:620
msgid ""
"Your first model is saved. Lighting changes how your face looks to the"
" camera: a model recorded in daylight can fail in the evening under la"
"mps (or the other way round), and Ubuntu Hello then times out instead "
"of unlocking. A second model recorded in different light keeps recogni"
"tion reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Muundo wako wa kwanza umehifadhiwa. Mwangaza hubadilisha jinsi uso wak"
"o unavyoonekana kwenye kamera: kielelezo kilichorekodiwa mchana kinawe"
"za kuharibika jioni chini ya taa (au kwa upande mwingine), na Ubuntu H"
"ello kisha kuzima badala ya kufungua. Muundo wa pili uliorekodiwa kwa "
"mwanga tofauti huweka utambuzi kutegemewa wakati wowote wa siku."

#: src/onboarding.py:622
msgid ""
"Change the lighting first: switch the room light or desk lamp on or of"
"f, turn away from the window, or put on the glasses you sometimes wear"
". Then look straight into the camera and press Scan."
msgstr ""
"Badilisha taa kwanza: washa au uzime taa ya chumba au taa ya mezani, u"
"geuke mbali na dirisha, au vaa miwani unayovaa wakati mwingine. Kisha "
"angalia moja kwa moja kwenye kamera na ubonyeze Changanua."

#: src/onboarding.py:660
msgid "Ubuntu Hello Setup"
msgstr "Ubuntu Hello Weka Mipangilio"

#: src/onboarding.py:673
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Checking TPM hardware a"
"nd tools..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inaweza kufungua kiotomatiki {} yako kwa kutumia uthibiti"
"shaji wa uso (pochi iliyotambuliwa: {}).\n\n<b>Hali ya TPM:</b> Inakag"
"ua maunzi na zana za TPM..."

#: src/onboarding.py:693
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected. "
"Installing <i>tpm2-tools</i> automatically..."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inaweza kufungua kiotomatiki {} yako kwa kutumia uthibiti"
"shaji wa uso (pochi iliyotambuliwa: {}).\n\n<b>Hali ya TPM:</b> maunzi"
" ya TPM yamegunduliwa. Inasakinisha <i>tpm2-tools</i> kiotomatiki..."

#: src/onboarding.py:705
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> Hardware TPM 2.0 active"
". Your password will be securely sealed inside the TPM."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inaweza kufungua kiotomatiki {} yako kwa kutumia uthibiti"
"shaji wa uso (pochi iliyotambuliwa: {}).\n\n<b>Hali ya TPM:</b> Vifaa "
"vya TPM 2.0 vinatumika. Nenosiri lako litafungwa kwa usalama ndani ya "
"TPM."

#: src/onboarding.py:707
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> TPM hardware detected, "
"but automatic installation of <i>tpm2-tools</i> failed. Run <code>sudo"
" apt install tpm2-tools</code>. Falling back to software-based credent"
"ial caching."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inaweza kufungua kiotomatiki {} yako kwa kutumia uthibiti"
"shaji wa uso (pochi iliyotambuliwa: {}).\n\n<b>Hali ya TPM:</b> maunzi"
" ya TPM yamegunduliwa, lakini usakinishaji kiotomatiki wa <i>tpm2-tool"
"s</i> haukufaulu. Endesha <code>sudo apt install tpm2-tools</code>. In"
"arudi kwenye uhifadhi wa kitambulisho kulingana na programu."

#: src/onboarding.py:709
msgid ""
"Ubuntu Hello can automatically unlock your {} using face authenticatio"
"n (detected wallet: {}).\n\n<b>TPM Status:</b> No TPM hardware detecte"
"d. Using software-based credential caching (AES-256-GCM)."
msgstr ""
"Ubuntu Hello inaweza kufungua kiotomatiki {} yako kwa kutumia uthibiti"
"shaji wa uso (pochi iliyotambuliwa: {}).\n\n<b>Hali ya TPM:</b> Hakuna"
" maunzi ya TPM yaliyogunduliwa. Kwa kutumia uakibishaji wa kitambulish"
"o kulingana na programu (AES-256-GCM)."

